1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,050
Why do tennis balls have fuzz?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,300
Oh, I KNOW this one.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,069
The fuzz is just for looks! Bald is faster.

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,400
Actually...

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,475
The fuzz grabs the air and slows the ball down,

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,805
so you can actually hit it back.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,452
It grips the strings for spin, too.

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,448
Poor thing. It must be freezing!
